{"level": "Pre-Intermediate", "number": 1, "title": "Workbook \u00b7 Unit 1A & 1C \u2014 Communication", "kind": "handout", "passages": {}, "layout": "<div class=\"booklet\" data-lang=\"uz\"><p><span>WORKBOOK  \u00b7  PRE-INTERMEDIATE  \u00b7  UNIT 1</span></p><p><span>Communication</span></p><p><span>1A Do you play any sports?  \u00b7  1C It was really nice to meet you</span></p><table class=\"bk\"><tr><td><p><span>You will learn to</span></p><p><span>\u2014  </span>odamlar, joylar va narsalarni tasvirlaydigan sifatlarni \u2014 <span style=\"font-style:italic\">delicious, awful, strange, rude</span></p><p><span>\u2014  </span>savolni to\u02bbg\u02bbri tartibda tuzishni \u2014 <span style=\"font-style:italic\">Where did you meet\u2026? What was the film like?</span></p><p><span>\u2014  </span>salomlashish va suhbatni tugatish iboralarini \u2014 <span style=\"font-style:italic\">Long time no see! I really must go.</span></p><p><span>\u2014  </span>gapda qaysi so\u02bbzlarga urg\u02bbu tushishini eshitishni</p></td></tr></table><table class=\"bk\"><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:#127D80;border-top:0;border-bottom:0;border-left:0;border-right:0\"><p style=\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:0px\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:13pt\">1</span></p></td><td style=\"vertical-align:top;border-top:0;border-bottom:1px solid #127D80;border-left:0;border-right:0\"><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#0B5456;font-size:12.5pt\">1A Vocabulary  \u00b7  common adjectives</span></p></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:5px;padding-left:32px\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#127D80;font-size:12pt\">1.1  </span><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">1a</span>  Choose the correct words to complete the sentences.</span></p><p class=\"hx-uz\" lang=\"uz\" style=\"margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:5px;padding-left:32px\">Gaplarni to\u02bbldirish uchun to\u02bbg\u02bbri so\u02bbzni tanlang.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:6px;line-height:1.45;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">1  </span>The new building opposite the university is <span style=\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">ugly</span>. I hate it!  <span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">(example)</span></span></p><p data-item=\"1.1:2\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">2  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">Our new teacher is always very <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"1\" style=\"width:130px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> . We work very hard in her lessons, and she never smiles or laughs.</span></p><p data-item=\"1.1:3\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">3  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">The cakes in the new bakery are <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"2\" style=\"width:130px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> !</span></p><p data-item=\"1.1:4\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">4  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">My brother's new girlfriend is <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"3\" style=\"width:130px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> . I think she's a model.</span></p><p data-item=\"1.1:5\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">5  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">We played a lot of <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"4\" style=\"width:130px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> games at Sarah's birthday party. I have some really funny photos on Facebook.</span></p><p data-item=\"1.1:6\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">6  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">Lily's a <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"5\" style=\"width:130px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> person. Her grandchildren love visiting her.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:5px;padding-left:32px\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#127D80;font-size:12pt\">1.2  </span><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">1b</span>  Complete the sentences with the adjectives in the box.</span></p><p class=\"hx-uz\" lang=\"uz\" style=\"margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:5px;padding-left:32px\">Gaplarni qutichadagi sifatlar bilan to\u02bbldiring.</p><table class=\"bk\"><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:#F2F8F8;border-left:3px solid #127D80\"><p style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.6\"><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">all right  \u00b7  awful  \u00b7  amazing  \u00b7  delicious  \u00b7  rude  \u00b7  strange  \u00b7  perfect</span></p></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin-bottom:6px;line-height:1.45;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">1  </span>I'm not interested in football. It's so <span style=\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">boring</span>.  <span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">(example)</span></span></p><p data-item=\"1.2:2\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">2  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">Thanks for the chocolates. They were <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"6\" style=\"width:130px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> !</span></p><p data-item=\"1.2:3\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">3  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">Look at this beautiful weather \u2013 it's a <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"7\" style=\"width:130px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> day to go to the beach.</span></p><p data-item=\"1.2:4\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">4  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">The film we watched last night was really <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"8\" style=\"width:130px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> . I didn't understand it at all.</span></p><p data-item=\"1.2:5\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">5  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">A</span> How was the restaurant?  <span style=\"font-weight:700\">B</span> Oh, it was <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"9\" style=\"width:130px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> . There are better Italian restaurants in my town.</span></p><p data-item=\"1.2:6\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">6  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">The weather in Scotland was <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"10\" style=\"width:130px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> . It rained every day.</span></p><p data-item=\"1.2:7\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">7  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">The band were <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"11\" style=\"width:130px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> ! It was the best concert I've ever been to.</span></p><p data-item=\"1.2:8\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">8  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">The waiter at the hotel was <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"12\" style=\"width:130px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> . He said he couldn't help us because we're vegetarian.</span></p><table class=\"bk\"><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:#127D80;border-top:0;border-bottom:0;border-left:0;border-right:0\"><p style=\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:0px\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:13pt\">2</span></p></td><td style=\"vertical-align:top;border-top:0;border-bottom:1px solid #127D80;border-left:0;border-right:0\"><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#0B5456;font-size:12.5pt\">1A Grammar  \u00b7  question forms</span></p></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:5px;padding-left:32px\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#127D80;font-size:12pt\">2.1  </span><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">2a</span>  Choose the correct words to complete the questions.</span></p><p class=\"hx-uz\" lang=\"uz\" style=\"margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:5px;padding-left:32px\">Savollarni to\u02bbldirish uchun to\u02bbg\u02bbri variantni tanlang.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:6px;line-height:1.45;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">1  </span>How many children <span style=\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">does he have</span>?  <span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">(example)</span></span></p><p data-item=\"2.1:2\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">2  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">Where <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"13\" style=\"width:130px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> your husband?</span></p><p data-item=\"2.1:3\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">3  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\"><input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"14\" style=\"width:130px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> in this area?</span></p><p data-item=\"2.1:4\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">4  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">What <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"15\" style=\"width:130px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> ?</span></p><p data-item=\"2.1:5\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">5  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">How much <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"16\" style=\"width:130px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> for your smartphone?</span></p><p data-item=\"2.1:6\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">6  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\"><input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"17\" style=\"width:130px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> to the USA?</span></p><p data-item=\"2.1:7\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">7  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">How many films <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"18\" style=\"width:130px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> last year?</span></p><p data-item=\"2.1:8\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">8  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">How <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"19\" style=\"width:130px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> ?</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:5px;padding-left:32px\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#127D80;font-size:12pt\">2.2  </span><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">2b</span>  Put the words in the correct order to make questions.</span></p><p class=\"hx-uz\" lang=\"uz\" style=\"margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:5px;padding-left:32px\">So\u02bbzlarni to\u02bbg\u02bbri tartibda qo\u02bbyib, savol tuzing.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:6px;line-height:1.45;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">1  </span>you / Sarah's friend / are ?  \u2192  <span style=\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">Are you Sarah's friend?</span>  <span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">(example)</span></span></p><p data-item=\"2.2:2\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">2  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">work / a bank / he / does / in ?  <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"20\" style=\"width:95%\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" placeholder=\"the question\"></span></p><p data-item=\"2.2:3\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">3  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">you / last month / to New York / go / did / why ?  <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"21\" style=\"width:95%\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" placeholder=\"the question\"></span></p><p data-item=\"2.2:4\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">4  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">like / that new Brazilian / what / restaurant / is ?  <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"22\" style=\"width:95%\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" placeholder=\"the question\"></span></p><p data-item=\"2.2:5\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">5  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">with your sister / who / that man / was ?  <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"23\" style=\"width:95%\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" placeholder=\"the question\"></span></p><p data-item=\"2.2:6\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">6  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">TV programmes / you / do / watch / what type of ?  <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"24\" style=\"width:95%\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" placeholder=\"the question\"></span></p><p data-item=\"2.2:7\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">7  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">go to / did / which university / you ?  <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"25\" style=\"width:95%\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" placeholder=\"the question\"></span></p><p data-item=\"2.2:8\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">8  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">did / how much / cost / the tickets ?  <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"26\" style=\"width:95%\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" placeholder=\"the question\"></span></p><table class=\"bk\"><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:#127D80;border-top:0;border-bottom:0;border-lef