le=\"margin-bottom:6px;line-height:1.45;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">JAMES</span>  Where are you living <span style=\"font-weight:700\">(4)</span> <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"29\" style=\"width:130px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> ?</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:6px;line-height:1.45;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">SAM</span>  Oh, not <span style=\"font-weight:700\">(5)</span> <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"30\" style=\"width:130px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> here. In Park Road, near the sports centre.</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:6px;line-height:1.45;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">JAMES</span>  Oh, <span style=\"font-weight:700\">(6)</span> <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"31\" style=\"width:130px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> nice!</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:6px;line-height:1.45;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">SAM</span>  And <span style=\"font-weight:700\">(7)</span> <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"32\" style=\"width:130px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> my wife, Jackie.</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:6px;line-height:1.45;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">JAMES</span>  Your wife \u2013 wow! That's fantastic <span style=\"font-weight:700\">(8)</span> <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"33\" style=\"width:130px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> !</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:6px;line-height:1.45;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">JAMES</span>  Nice